WEBVTT

00:45.254 --> 00:48.966
PERFECT CROWN

00:59.851 --> 01:01.060
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

01:01.061 --> 01:02.980
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

01:03.647 --> 01:04.730
EPISODE 11

01:05.816 --> 01:08.110
Your Royal Highness,
it is the Queen Mother.

01:15.158 --> 01:18.119
I'd like a brief audience
in the Council Hall.

01:18.120 --> 01:20.454
Do we have time
before we're due at the Throne Hall?

01:20.455 --> 01:21.832
Well…

01:22.833 --> 01:25.252
Yes, we have about 30 minutes.

01:26.128 --> 01:27.337
Right.

01:32.884 --> 01:33.885
Your Royal Highness.

01:35.137 --> 01:38.806
It seems like His Majesty wants to enter
the Throne Hall with you?

01:38.807 --> 01:39.890
His Majesty does?

01:39.891 --> 01:41.852
Yes. It appears he's a bit nervous.

01:45.856 --> 01:46.939
I'll meet you there.

01:46.940 --> 01:48.442
I won't be long.

01:49.609 --> 01:50.610
Ah…

01:55.157 --> 01:56.491
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

02:29.274 --> 02:30.275
Grand Princess.

02:30.901 --> 02:31.902
You must flee.

02:32.653 --> 02:35.447
Isn't that… the Council Hall?

02:36.239 --> 02:37.324
Grand Princess.

02:49.169 --> 02:50.170
No…

02:52.214 --> 02:53.881
No!

02:53.882 --> 02:55.050
Your Highness!

03:03.225 --> 03:04.768
What was that?

03:06.395 --> 03:08.479
Go and see what happened.

03:09.606 --> 03:10.899
Yes, Your Majesty.

03:34.464 --> 03:35.714
Aide Do.

03:35.715 --> 03:36.925
What…

03:39.010 --> 03:40.262
What are you doing here?

03:46.601 --> 03:47.811
Tell me.

03:51.481 --> 03:52.815
Do Hyejeong!

03:52.816 --> 03:54.192
The Council Hall…

03:57.195 --> 03:58.280
His Royal Highness.

03:59.322 --> 04:01.408
He's in the Council Hall.

04:02.033 --> 04:03.118
:cue

04:20.927 --> 04:21.928
Your Royal Highness.

04:24.973 --> 04:26.056
No!

04:26.057 --> 04:27.684
- Grand Princess!
- Ms. Seong!

04:28.602 --> 04:30.312
You can't, Grand Princess!

04:39.362 --> 04:41.990
PERFECT CROWN

04:54.544 --> 04:55.795
Is anyone…

04:55.796 --> 04:57.463
Is anyone out there?

04:57.464 --> 04:59.882
Your Royal Highness!

05:12.437 --> 05:13.438
Your Royal Highness!

05:14.022 --> 05:15.481
Your Royal Highness!

05:25.450 --> 05:27.702
If something terrible happens to you…

05:29.830 --> 05:30.956
You can't…

05:35.669 --> 05:37.087
Let's see this through.

05:40.924 --> 05:42.467
I will be by your side.

05:53.478 --> 05:54.479
Don't come.

05:56.064 --> 05:57.065
Your Royal Highness!

06:05.240 --> 06:07.242
Your Royal Highness!

06:08.493 --> 06:10.036
Your Royal Highness…

06:19.963 --> 06:21.047
Your Royal Highness.

06:22.257 --> 06:23.340
Your Royal Highness!

06:30.765 --> 06:32.684
Your Royal Highness.

06:34.019 --> 06:35.269
Your Royal Highness.

06:35.270 --> 06:37.563
Your Royal Highness, you need to wake up.

06:47.032 --> 06:48.199
Your Royal Highness.

07:04.424 --> 07:05.842
Your Royal Highness.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.762
I'll get you out of here.

07:32.535 --> 07:33.619
Your Royal Highness.

07:33.620 --> 07:36.790
Your Royal Highness, please wake up.

07:40.418 --> 07:42.628
Someone, please save him.

07:42.629 --> 07:45.090
Is anyone out there?

07:46.466 --> 07:48.510
Is there anyone out there?

07:54.891 --> 07:57.268
Please help us…

07:59.062 --> 08:00.063
Your Royal Highness.

08:01.022 --> 08:02.273
Your Royal Highness…

08:06.778 --> 08:08.029
Mother!

08:08.530 --> 08:09.531
Your Majesty.

08:10.031 --> 08:12.909
Mother, there's a fire in the palace.

08:13.868 --> 08:15.203
What is he talking about?

08:15.787 --> 08:17.789
A fire has broken out at the Council Hall.

08:18.415 --> 08:20.750
Uncle is…

08:26.798 --> 08:28.049
Is I-AN safe?

08:28.717 --> 08:29.801
Your Majesty…

08:30.927 --> 08:32.137
Answer me!

08:33.179 --> 08:34.472
Is I-AN safe?
:cue

08:51.489 --> 08:54.367
You should get some rest, Grand Princess.

08:54.951 --> 08:57.203
The royal physicians said he is stable.

08:58.788 --> 09:02.458
How could you have just run
into the fire like that?

09:02.459 --> 09:04.543
Had Aide Choi not reached you in time,

09:04.544 --> 09:05.753
you would also be…

09:05.754 --> 09:07.464
He would've come to save me.

09:08.882 --> 09:09.883
Pardon?

09:11.843 --> 09:15.055
If it had been me in there, he would have…

09:19.601 --> 09:20.977
come for me too.

09:22.228 --> 09:23.354
To save me.

09:26.483 --> 09:28.109
Like he always has.

09:34.908 --> 09:38.161
Sir, you need to be announced first! Ah…

09:51.716 --> 09:53.509
The Grand Prince is stable, so tomorrow--

09:53.510 --> 09:55.386
How could you just run in there like that?

09:57.013 --> 09:59.973
Lower your voice.
The palace attendants are outside.

09:59.974 --> 10:01.309
Why aren't you at a hospital?

10:02.477 --> 10:04.979
You should at least get proper treatment.

10:05.730 --> 10:07.940
How can I trust any hospital right now?

10:07.941 --> 10:10.318
- What?
- You think this fire was just an accident?

10:12.862 --> 10:15.572
They targeted the Grand Prince
at the wedding, not me.

10:15.573 --> 10:17.908
And now, a fire just breaks out
on abdication day?

10:17.909 --> 10:19.077
You expect me to buy that?

10:23.248 --> 10:24.582
And if it wasn't an accident?

10:26.501 --> 10:28.920
- What?
- What can you do if it wasn't?

10:29.838 --> 10:32.840
Will you collapse and die in his place?

10:33.925 --> 10:36.135
Then what should I have done?

10:36.136 --> 10:38.596
- Just leave him there to die?
- Yes, just leave him!

10:41.516 --> 10:42.851
Jeongwoo.

10:48.690 --> 10:51.067
How much longer
must I watch you be in danger?

10:55.780 --> 10:57.574
How much longer must I endure this?

11:21.181 --> 11:22.974
I've been looking everywhere for you.

11:24.309 --> 11:25.435
What are you doing here?

11:32.442 --> 11:33.484
Are you okay?

11:36.946 --> 11:38.071
Yes.

11:39.949 --> 11:42.826
I'm told the Grand Prince
and Princess are both fine.

11:42.827 --> 11:44.579
You don't need to worry too much.

11:53.254 --> 11:55.839
I'm sorry.

11:55.840 --> 11:58.218
What? Why are you apologizing?

12:00.303 --> 12:01.386
I mean…

12:04.599 --> 12:07.267
I should've never left
the Grand Prince's side, right?

12:07.268 --> 12:08.685
Wait, come on now.

12:08.686 --> 12:11.438
It's not like your being there

12:11.439 --> 12:13.690
would've magically stopped
the fire from starting.

12:13.691 --> 12:15.360
Come on, that's silly.

12:22.033 --> 12:25.077
Wait, hold on. Do you really believe that?

12:38.549 --> 12:39.634
Thank you.

12:40.343 --> 12:41.344
What?

12:42.637 --> 12:44.304
-  Grand Princess!
-  Ms. Seong!

12:44.305 --> 12:45.848
You can't, Grand Princess!

12:53.856 --> 12:54.940
I'll be right back.

12:54.941 --> 12:56.441
What? Where are you going?

12:56.442 --> 12:57.943
No, you can't!

12:57.944 --> 13:00.696
Aide Choi! Choi Hyeon!

13:11.749 --> 13:12.874
A royal physician!

13:12.875 --> 13:14.376
Summon a royal physician!

13:20.717 --> 13:21.843
Thank goodness…

13:22.760 --> 13:24.053
Thank goodness.
:cue

13:30.601 --> 13:32.436
If it weren't for you, they would both be…

13:32.437 --> 13:33.438
Oh.

13:34.063 --> 13:35.856
Stop that.

13:35.857 --> 13:38.443
I mean, I was just doing my job.

13:47.618 --> 13:48.703
I was worried…

13:50.663 --> 13:51.873
that you'd get hurt.

14:16.439 --> 14:17.440
Thank you.

14:19.609 --> 14:20.610
But you know,

14:21.194 --> 14:22.528
I just got all better.

14:26.032 --> 14:27.908
Oh, ow, ow… Hold on. Ow…

14:27.909 --> 14:29.202
Are you okay?

14:30.036 --> 14:32.579
It's so itchy right here.
Can you scratch it for me?

14:33.790 --> 14:35.791
Why are you crying?

14:35.792 --> 14:37.000
Don't cry.

14:37.001 --> 14:39.462
Crying one second and laughing the next?

14:40.046 --> 14:41.963
Just pick one already.

14:41.964 --> 14:43.298
You're no crybaby.

14:43.299 --> 14:45.510
Where are all these tears coming from?
Huh?

14:55.311 --> 14:57.020
What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?

14:57.021 --> 14:58.814
Should we go to the hospital?

14:58.815 --> 14:59.816
Why was he…

15:01.275 --> 15:03.235
at the Council Hall today?

15:03.236 --> 15:05.446
He was due to accept
the abdication in the Throne Hall.

15:06.239 --> 15:07.240
Oh…

15:07.990 --> 15:10.242
Prime Minister Min texted,
asking for a quick chat

15:10.243 --> 15:11.410
at the Council Hall.

15:14.664 --> 15:15.915
Jeongwoo…

15:17.375 --> 15:18.668
had him go there?

15:20.545 --> 15:21.754
Yes.

15:51.659 --> 15:52.702
Your Royal Highness.

15:54.745 --> 15:56.164
Your Royal Highness!

16:08.467 --> 16:09.468
Stay still.

16:21.314 --> 16:22.857
I must appear…

16:24.233 --> 16:25.610
insanely infatuated with you

16:26.903 --> 16:28.321
for people to believe

16:29.614 --> 16:31.324
this absurd marriage is genuine.

16:34.202 --> 16:35.453
Do not bend to their will.

16:37.163 --> 16:38.247
Do not back away

16:39.957 --> 16:41.292
and do not compromise.

16:46.047 --> 16:47.757
I shall fight with all that I have.

16:51.886 --> 16:53.095
Just as you do.

16:57.183 --> 16:59.352
I have a great deal that you do not…

17:00.770 --> 17:02.521
and if you ask for it,

17:03.898 --> 17:05.608
I fully intend to provide it.

17:50.570 --> 17:53.239
I thought you said
the palace was the safest.

17:57.285 --> 18:00.121
Is there any place safe for you?
:cue

18:15.886 --> 18:18.430
The Council Hall was
practically empty at the time.

18:18.431 --> 18:20.641
For an explosion that big,
casualties are minimal.

18:21.392 --> 18:24.144
We will make a joint statement
with the Royal Secretariat--

18:24.145 --> 18:25.438
No need.

18:26.897 --> 18:27.898
Just leave it for now.

18:28.566 --> 18:29.734
Pardon?

18:30.901 --> 18:32.695
Let's leave it until the Grand Prince…

18:34.196 --> 18:35.364
wakes up.

18:38.951 --> 18:42.621
Last night, a major fire broke out
at Gyeongbokgung Palace.

18:42.622 --> 18:47.751
Witnesses at Gwanghwamun Square
reported hearing a loud explosion.

18:47.752 --> 18:50.295
With no official statement
from the palace yet,

18:50.296 --> 18:53.340
there are growing concerns
over the safety of the royal family.

18:53.341 --> 18:55.425
I want the past month's CCTV footage

18:55.426 --> 18:57.802
of the Council Hall interior,
entrance, and corridors.

18:57.803 --> 18:59.179
Have it copied and sent over.

18:59.180 --> 19:00.806
Is three days enough to review?

19:03.059 --> 19:05.894
With Court Lady Choi, Aide Choi,

19:05.895 --> 19:08.605
and Castle Beauty's Exec Ops on board,

19:08.606 --> 19:10.148
we'll make it happen.

19:10.149 --> 19:13.653
I want to question every attendant,
Royal Guard, and official

19:14.236 --> 19:17.072
in the vicinity of the Council Hall
at the time of the incident.

19:17.073 --> 19:20.241
Uh, that would fall
under the Inner Court's jurisdiction.

19:20.242 --> 19:21.368
Mmm…

19:21.369 --> 19:23.829
I'll ask for cooperation
from the Queen Mother's Quarters.

19:25.748 --> 19:26.749
No need.

19:27.917 --> 19:30.086
I'll just ask her myself.

19:37.885 --> 19:39.804
Is I-AN all right?

19:42.640 --> 19:45.100
I wanted to visit him
at Anhwadang Hall, but…

19:45.101 --> 19:46.519
Worried that he might actually…

19:48.145 --> 19:49.313
pull through?

19:52.650 --> 19:55.069
It happened as he was
about to accept the abdication.

19:55.986 --> 19:57.655
And Your Majesty was the only one

19:58.280 --> 19:59.740
who was against it.

20:01.617 --> 20:03.284
Grand Princess, I…

20:03.285 --> 20:05.204
If you don't want to be a suspect,

20:05.788 --> 20:07.206
grant me unfettered access

20:08.332 --> 20:10.583
to the palace attendants' shift records.

20:16.173 --> 20:18.300
His Royal Highness will pull through.

20:22.179 --> 20:23.180
That's the only way…

20:32.356 --> 20:34.692
you make it out of this unscathed.

20:39.947 --> 20:40.948
Oh…

20:42.408 --> 20:44.744
I'm afraid I don't accept drinks
so freely anymore.

20:57.298 --> 20:58.299
And the investigation?

20:58.799 --> 20:59.924
When will it begin?

20:59.925 --> 21:02.177
The Royal Protection Branch
will start it first,

21:02.178 --> 21:04.345
and the police will join later.

21:04.346 --> 21:05.389
It will not be public.

21:06.557 --> 21:07.558
Why not public?

21:08.851 --> 21:10.560
It came from the prime minister.

21:10.561 --> 21:14.105
With the poisoning case still open,
he wanted to keep things from escalating.

21:14.106 --> 21:15.691
He should be at Anhwadang Hall now.

21:17.193 --> 21:18.277
Who?

21:18.986 --> 21:21.113
- Prime Minister Min?
- Yes.

21:33.209 --> 21:34.210
Did you run over here?

21:39.131 --> 21:41.049
He should've been awake by now,

21:41.050 --> 21:42.551
but I hadn't heard anything yet.

21:44.512 --> 21:45.804
Right.

21:45.805 --> 21:49.307
The royal physician said he's
in a near-comatose state due to stress.

21:49.308 --> 21:52.520
It's a sign his body is recovering,
so he should be waking up soon.

21:53.938 --> 21:54.939
When is "soon"?

21:56.273 --> 21:57.607
Well, that is…

21:57.608 --> 22:00.069
Apparently, there's no way of knowing.

22:02.279 --> 22:03.489
Let's give it some time.

22:13.040 --> 22:14.583
You didn't need to see me out.

22:16.627 --> 22:17.628
Sorry.

22:20.840 --> 22:22.800
Maybe it's everything
that's been going on.

22:23.926 --> 22:25.344
I'm a little on edge.

22:30.140 --> 22:32.726
By the way, don't you go
to the cathedral anymore?

22:34.019 --> 22:35.020
What?

22:35.938 --> 22:37.356
You're not wearing your rosary.
:cue

22:39.650 --> 22:41.317
Ah…

22:41.318 --> 22:42.945
It gets in the way when I work.

22:43.445 --> 22:44.822
Right.

22:48.617 --> 22:49.910
Get back safely.

22:50.870 --> 22:52.246
Thanks.

23:19.273 --> 23:20.356
What's wrong?

23:20.357 --> 23:22.610
Huiju hasn't texted back yet?

23:23.235 --> 23:24.236
No.

23:24.778 --> 23:26.655
Let's eat.

23:27.489 --> 23:28.574
What should we get?

23:29.867 --> 23:30.950
This place is known for…

23:30.951 --> 23:32.620
-  At the palace?
- Yeah.

23:33.120 --> 23:34.663
Someone definitely died there.

23:35.539 --> 23:38.917
Why else would they refuse
to make an official statement?

23:38.918 --> 23:40.001
No way.

23:40.002 --> 23:41.836
I did hear the explosion was really loud.

23:41.837 --> 23:43.756
I read this rumor post…

23:44.590 --> 23:46.050
It said Grand Prince I-AN…

23:47.593 --> 23:48.927
is dead.

23:48.928 --> 23:50.219
Oh, this…

23:52.097 --> 23:55.476
- Babe, you need to call Huiju now.
- Okay.

24:05.110 --> 24:07.445
Would it kill her to pick up
on the first try?

24:07.446 --> 24:09.657
- She's not picking up? Let me try.
- Okay.

24:10.157 --> 24:13.576
INCOMING CALL
GREMLIN

24:26.507 --> 24:27.508
Sir.

24:28.759 --> 24:30.426
I'm a little tired today.

24:30.427 --> 24:31.720
Can we save it for tomorrow?

24:33.138 --> 24:35.933
The Royal Secretariat wants
to release a statement.

24:40.896 --> 24:42.230
The reason being?

24:42.231 --> 24:45.191
There's a rumor circulating
that the Grand Prince has passed away.

24:45.192 --> 24:48.528
The string of canceled public appearances
has also raised concerns.

24:48.529 --> 24:51.322
There's even talk
the Grand Princess is in a critical state.

24:51.323 --> 24:52.865
Hmm…

24:52.866 --> 24:53.867
That should be

24:54.785 --> 24:55.786
more than enough.

25:06.380 --> 25:08.215
What on earth are you talking about?

25:09.508 --> 25:10.758
What do you mean, regency?

25:10.759 --> 25:13.220
Public concern is growing
over the welfare of the Crown.

25:14.304 --> 25:16.931
However, His Majesty is unable
to carry out state affairs.

25:16.932 --> 25:19.100
Since the Grand Prince
remains unconscious,

25:19.101 --> 25:22.770
it would only be fitting
for Your Majesty to step forward.

25:22.771 --> 25:24.773
The Grand Prince will wake up soon.

25:25.315 --> 25:27.108
- The Grand Princess said--
- That is why

25:27.109 --> 25:29.028
I have come here in such a hurry.

25:33.490 --> 25:36.285
Ending the Grand Prince's regency
was no simple matter.

25:37.327 --> 25:39.495
Likewise, once Your Majesty
takes up the regency,

25:39.496 --> 25:41.205
it will not be easily undone.

25:41.206 --> 25:42.874
Even if the Grand Prince wakes up.

25:42.875 --> 25:44.877
That would be a rash decision.

25:45.836 --> 25:47.504
- There is still time--
- Your Majesty.

25:51.467 --> 25:53.218
If the notion bothers you so…

25:53.844 --> 25:57.473
"Fulfill your duties to the Crown
as a representative of the people."

25:59.391 --> 26:00.934
I can make it an official order.

26:07.524 --> 26:08.567
So what will it be?

26:18.035 --> 26:19.328
Your Majesty.

26:19.870 --> 26:21.663
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

26:37.638 --> 26:38.889
I-AN…

26:43.310 --> 26:46.355
Please forgive me
for causing you concern, Your Majesty.

26:52.111 --> 26:53.112
Did I…

26:55.823 --> 26:56.990
cause you much distress?
:cue

27:08.585 --> 27:11.380
SAJEONGJEON HALL WEST ENTRANCE
ACCESS LOG

27:12.881 --> 27:16.050
I expected there would be a lot,

27:16.051 --> 27:17.260
but this is unreal.

27:17.261 --> 27:18.679
Even if it's extensive,

27:19.429 --> 27:23.308
attendants follow a strict routine,
so any irregularities will stand out.

27:24.518 --> 27:26.727
Plus, only a few
have access to the Council Hall.

27:26.728 --> 27:27.729
Right.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.564
Your Royal Highness!

27:32.067 --> 27:34.278
The Grand Prince is awake!

27:35.070 --> 27:36.154
Your Royal Highness!

28:37.049 --> 28:38.383
You shouldn't have been there.

28:40.177 --> 28:42.387
If something happened to you…

28:47.851 --> 28:49.561
How could I possibly stay out…

28:51.647 --> 28:54.690
…when I knew you were in there?

29:04.034 --> 29:05.035
I'm sorry.

29:07.079 --> 29:08.121
Forgive me.

29:54.584 --> 29:56.294
When did you wake up?

29:57.087 --> 29:58.088
Just now.

29:59.172 --> 30:00.841
Have you seen the royal physician?

30:03.385 --> 30:05.011
It was just a long nap.

30:05.012 --> 30:06.013
He says I'm fine.

30:10.559 --> 30:12.935
I'll resume my public duties at once.

30:12.936 --> 30:14.020
Don't worry.

30:14.021 --> 30:16.939
First, we should let you fully recover.

30:16.940 --> 30:17.941
Prime Minister Min.

30:19.317 --> 30:22.112
I hear rumors of my passing
are spreading outside these walls.

30:26.867 --> 30:28.118
Now is the perfect time

30:29.286 --> 30:30.537
to turn public opinion.

30:59.107 --> 31:01.109
Since the Grand Prince
has regained consciousness,

31:02.611 --> 31:04.362
it's time we tied up some loose ends.

31:09.659 --> 31:12.370
LORD INPYEONG

31:16.792 --> 31:19.461
:cue

31:51.326 --> 31:53.328
Are you sure you're okay now?

31:53.912 --> 31:55.580
I told you I'm fine.

31:56.748 --> 31:59.042
Shall I call for
the royal physician again?

32:06.091 --> 32:07.092
So…

32:08.176 --> 32:10.804
why did you go see the Queen Mother
as soon as you woke up?

32:11.680 --> 32:13.265
To see Prime Minister Min.

32:14.724 --> 32:15.933
Jeongwoo?

32:15.934 --> 32:18.061
With my waking being uncertain,

32:18.770 --> 32:21.857
he would have to find someone
to take my place.

32:22.566 --> 32:23.608
"Take your place"?

32:27.612 --> 32:30.782
Are you saying he asked
the Queen Mother to act as regent?

32:33.702 --> 32:34.828
So did you go there

32:35.412 --> 32:37.539
to show them you're alive and well?

32:38.665 --> 32:41.001
Yeah.

32:44.129 --> 32:45.130
Listen.

32:46.590 --> 32:47.716
How much

32:49.384 --> 32:50.676
do you trust Jeongwoo?

32:50.677 --> 32:51.970
That's random.

32:53.096 --> 32:54.848
I mean, you two are friends,

32:55.640 --> 32:58.018
but it's so impersonal
between you two sometimes.

32:58.685 --> 33:00.437
Like that time with the contract.

33:04.191 --> 33:05.775
There are times I want to punch him.

33:06.651 --> 33:08.195
- What?
- But…

33:10.030 --> 33:11.615
I've always trusted him.

33:14.242 --> 33:15.367
Why?

33:15.368 --> 33:17.537
Because I know

33:18.246 --> 33:21.791
just as I'm bound by the Crown,
he's bound by the Cabinet.

33:29.716 --> 33:30.799
Why do you ask?

33:30.800 --> 33:34.221
Weren't you the one who said it was
only common sense to trust him?

33:39.643 --> 33:40.852
Come here.

34:00.872 --> 34:02.122
There he is!

34:02.123 --> 34:04.833
The arsonist responsible
for the fire at Gyeongbokgung Palace

34:04.834 --> 34:06.126
turned himself in last night.

34:06.127 --> 34:07.836
During questioning, the suspect, Shin,

34:07.837 --> 34:10.005
was identified as a member
of the Royal Guard.

34:10.006 --> 34:11.882
An assassination suspect emerging

34:11.883 --> 34:13.842
from the very force sworn
to protect the Crown

34:13.843 --> 34:15.261
is sending shock waves nationwide.

34:15.262 --> 34:16.720
Remove him!

34:16.721 --> 34:17.930
He was also confirmed

34:17.931 --> 34:20.475
to have protested
for the Grand Prince to step down.

34:22.185 --> 34:23.186
How amusing.

34:24.312 --> 34:25.814
It's as if they timed it to my waking.

34:28.191 --> 34:31.318
Your Majesty,
Grand Prince I-AN has arrived.

34:31.319 --> 34:32.487
Show him in.

34:36.574 --> 34:37.909
Uncle!

34:41.204 --> 34:42.205
Your Majesty.

34:43.164 --> 34:44.623
Are you well?

34:44.624 --> 34:46.751
Yes, that is why I am here.

34:49.629 --> 34:51.840
The fire at the Council Hall…

35:05.186 --> 35:09.315
I thought you would end up like Father…

35:11.860 --> 35:13.528
Do not think such thoughts.

35:14.988 --> 35:16.031
I will

35:16.531 --> 35:18.116
always be by Your Majesty's side.
:cue

35:32.297 --> 35:36.217
I heard the Grand Prince and Princess
are to resume their public duties.

35:36.801 --> 35:39.011
This is their chance.

35:39.012 --> 35:40.596
They will not let it go to waste.

35:40.597 --> 35:43.058
Compassion and pity are but fleeting.

35:45.226 --> 35:47.186
You must stop them from resuming

35:47.187 --> 35:49.146
until that fleeting moment passes.

35:49.147 --> 35:51.441
What makes you think
they will listen to me?

35:51.941 --> 35:52.942
Your Majesty!

35:58.406 --> 36:01.284
The Grand Prince nearly lost
his life in a gas explosion.

36:02.452 --> 36:04.078
Use his welfare as grounds

36:04.079 --> 36:06.164
to keep them from resuming their duties.

36:12.504 --> 36:13.588
Father.

36:18.885 --> 36:21.471
How did you know the fire was caused

36:23.139 --> 36:24.724
by a gas explosion?

36:30.313 --> 36:32.439
What exactly are you getting at?

36:32.440 --> 36:34.901
That fact was withheld from the public.

36:38.071 --> 36:39.823
So how do you know about that?

37:23.825 --> 37:24.826
Your Majesty.

37:25.452 --> 37:26.745
What is the matter?

37:28.121 --> 37:30.540
Your Majesty, you must steady yourself.

37:38.089 --> 37:40.216
It appears I will not
be able to protect you.

37:45.054 --> 37:46.055
Your Majesty…

37:48.600 --> 37:49.976
However, I shall see to it…

37:52.937 --> 37:54.439
that your family is kept safe.

37:57.484 --> 37:59.319
Your grace is boundless, Your Majesty.

38:11.956 --> 38:12.957
Seriously?

38:13.541 --> 38:16.543
How could one measly royal guard
blow up the Council Hall by himself?

38:16.544 --> 38:17.796
My thoughts exactly.

38:18.296 --> 38:21.673
The Royal Protection Branch is looking
for accomplices and co-conspirators--

38:21.674 --> 38:23.885
- I need to leave the palace.
- Leave the palace?

38:31.226 --> 38:33.520
Your Royal Highness,
the Queen Mother has arrived.

38:38.858 --> 38:39.859
Show her in.

38:50.870 --> 38:51.871
You may leave.

39:05.969 --> 39:07.011
What brings you here?

39:08.763 --> 39:09.931
Your Majesty.

39:11.224 --> 39:12.307
Please stand up.

39:12.308 --> 39:13.309
I have come…

39:14.727 --> 39:16.354
to report a grave offense.

39:26.573 --> 39:27.615
My father…

39:29.951 --> 39:31.953
is trying to kill you.

39:39.002 --> 39:41.588
This is the evidence
from the incident on your wedding day.
:cue

39:51.806 --> 39:53.765
LEE AREUM

39:53.766 --> 39:56.519
I also have the girl who used to work
at your private residence.

39:57.186 --> 39:58.563
She has sworn to testify.

40:03.192 --> 40:05.069
What is your intent in reporting this?

40:06.988 --> 40:08.364
The recent fire…

40:12.327 --> 40:14.162
It was likely my father's doing.

40:16.456 --> 40:17.582
So?

40:18.666 --> 40:20.001
Are you here to beg

40:21.044 --> 40:22.169
for his forgiveness?

40:22.170 --> 40:23.796
I am asking you to exact punishment.

40:26.466 --> 40:27.759
Punish me…

40:31.512 --> 40:32.639
and my father.

40:48.321 --> 40:49.989
Did you believe me incapable of it?

40:51.157 --> 40:52.575
And should I choose to do so…

40:54.744 --> 40:56.371
are you sure you can handle it?

41:06.714 --> 41:07.966
I shall try.

41:25.149 --> 41:26.609
It's almost hunting season.

41:27.735 --> 41:30.529
Right, since harvest season is
just around the corner.

41:30.530 --> 41:33.992
Tell them I will be declaring
hunting season this year.

41:35.368 --> 41:36.494
And not the royal family?

41:38.955 --> 41:40.748
The Grand Prince needs time to recover,

41:42.041 --> 41:44.419
and the Queen Mother
does not appreciate hunting.

41:46.337 --> 41:47.922
Then I'll do it.

41:50.842 --> 41:51.843
I guess I can do it.

42:01.644 --> 42:03.563
Is it because I am accepting
the royal edict?

42:05.815 --> 42:06.816
Why?

42:10.486 --> 42:11.821
Why do you fear me now?

42:17.785 --> 42:19.579
It is not that I fear you.

42:26.127 --> 42:27.128
I have…

42:31.257 --> 42:33.301
a duty to protect the Crown.

42:36.054 --> 42:37.764
Thus, I am protecting you.

42:38.765 --> 42:41.225
I am ensuring that neither my father
nor my own greed

42:42.351 --> 42:44.520
ever harm you or the Crown again.

42:47.440 --> 42:48.566
So please…

42:57.825 --> 42:58.868
Just spare…

43:01.120 --> 43:02.288
His Majesty.

43:14.967 --> 43:16.469
As great as the honor once was…

43:18.763 --> 43:20.306
so too shall your disgrace be.

43:22.767 --> 43:24.393
In both the royal family and history,

43:25.770 --> 43:27.396
you will forever remain a sinner.

43:32.568 --> 43:34.403
If that is the price to spare His Majesty…

43:40.326 --> 43:41.452
would you accept?

43:48.126 --> 43:49.335
It is more than enough.
:cue

44:11.065 --> 44:12.859
But…

44:13.651 --> 44:15.778
"hunting season" in the 21st century?

44:16.821 --> 44:18.030
What about animal rights?

44:20.700 --> 44:22.118
Think of it as a necessary evil.

44:24.287 --> 44:25.872
When harmful entities multiply…

44:28.791 --> 44:30.334
we can't protect what matters.

44:32.503 --> 44:33.796
And who determines that?

44:36.215 --> 44:37.383
The Crown?

44:42.263 --> 44:43.264
The nation.

44:47.310 --> 44:48.311
I see.

45:01.449 --> 45:03.201
So, you decide.

45:30.228 --> 45:31.395
I saw you caught the guy.

45:32.605 --> 45:34.315
Was he a harmful entity too?

46:04.387 --> 46:06.681
Hey. I'm on my way back.

46:08.557 --> 46:09.558
You're where?

46:19.110 --> 46:20.736
He's a little drunk.

46:21.612 --> 46:22.737
He's drunk?

46:22.738 --> 46:26.575
Gosh. He can't even hold his liquor…

46:30.538 --> 46:33.415
Boy, I'm tired. Who wants coffee?

46:33.416 --> 46:34.417
Me.

46:53.728 --> 46:54.895
Your Royal Highness.

46:55.980 --> 46:58.149
My dear wife.

47:03.612 --> 47:06.449
This is great.
I was feeling cooped up anyway.

47:06.949 --> 47:08.992
You were?

47:08.993 --> 47:09.994
Yeah.

47:10.536 --> 47:12.371
The palace is so much bigger,

47:13.122 --> 47:14.290
but far more stifling.

47:16.292 --> 47:18.127
Agreed.

47:28.471 --> 47:30.222
The Queen Mother came to see me earlier.

47:37.813 --> 47:39.315
She told me Lord INPYEONG…

47:45.654 --> 47:47.073
was behind the wedding incident.
:cue

47:57.833 --> 48:00.044
Seeing her beg so desperately
to spare His Majesty…

48:07.009 --> 48:08.469
I no longer know what I am to do.

48:33.244 --> 48:34.954
You have such a gentle heart.

48:36.831 --> 48:37.998
It breaks my heart.

48:54.390 --> 48:55.850
THE THIRTY-THIRD KING

48:57.226 --> 48:59.937
It will reach him this time, won't it?

49:01.772 --> 49:03.065
I believe so.

49:06.444 --> 49:07.736
I shall entrust it to you.

49:09.196 --> 49:11.031
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

49:28.424 --> 49:29.758
I heard you asked for me.

49:34.221 --> 49:36.223
I wanted to commend you
for your swift arrest

49:37.183 --> 49:38.851
of the arsonist.

49:41.854 --> 49:43.230
The police deserve the credit.

49:44.565 --> 49:47.526
I am well aware that nothing in this realm

49:48.235 --> 49:49.236
is beyond your reach.

49:52.865 --> 49:53.866
However,

49:55.743 --> 49:57.495
are you still far from concluding

50:00.706 --> 50:01.832
the poisoning case?

50:06.545 --> 50:08.214
Hmm…

50:15.888 --> 50:17.180
It won't be long now.

50:29.193 --> 50:30.736
Lord INPYEONG of the Yun Family.

50:34.156 --> 50:35.407
He is the culprit.

50:36.325 --> 50:37.326
In terms of punishment,

50:38.327 --> 50:39.453
I'm still deliberating.

50:43.499 --> 50:44.792
About Prime Minister Min…

50:49.004 --> 50:50.130
Be wary of him.

50:53.509 --> 50:54.552
What does that mean?

50:55.052 --> 50:58.556
He was the first
to discover my father's crimes.

51:02.643 --> 51:04.770
- That is not possible.
- He knew everything,

51:05.312 --> 51:07.397
but chose to keep it from you.

51:07.398 --> 51:09.108
He would have no reason to do that.

51:10.818 --> 51:12.653
Do you truly believe that?

51:14.655 --> 51:15.823
How much

51:16.824 --> 51:18.033
do you trust Jeongwoo?

51:21.579 --> 51:24.790
Those driven by desperate desire…

51:29.086 --> 51:31.380
often resort to unseemly choices.
:cue

51:45.060 --> 51:46.604
What is there to consider?

51:48.314 --> 51:50.648
As someone who is concerned
for the Crown's welfare,

51:50.649 --> 51:51.942
I have much to consider.

51:52.610 --> 51:54.402
He tried to kill me.

51:54.403 --> 51:56.154
He's also the Queen Mother's father.

51:56.155 --> 51:58.656
- Prime Minister Min.
- And His Majesty's grandfather.

51:58.657 --> 52:00.409
- Min Jeongwoo.
- Please!

52:10.836 --> 52:12.671
Stop acting like a child.

52:22.765 --> 52:24.350
Lord INPYEONG will…

52:25.351 --> 52:27.018
…never set foot in this realm again.

52:27.019 --> 52:28.020
He will…

52:31.690 --> 52:33.317
carry out his sentence in this realm.

52:35.152 --> 52:37.111
Do you wish to see the Crown crumble?

52:37.112 --> 52:39.031
Is there any reason why it should not?

52:47.873 --> 52:48.874
The Crown…

52:51.543 --> 52:52.795
cannot last forever.

52:57.549 --> 52:58.842
Once I ascend the throne,

53:00.511 --> 53:02.012
I will abolish the monarchy.

53:21.365 --> 53:23.617
You've attained
everything you ever wanted.

53:25.786 --> 53:27.663
And now you seek freedom as well?

53:32.501 --> 53:33.502
This freedom…

53:35.295 --> 53:36.296
won't be mine alone.

54:16.378 --> 54:17.379
Are you okay?

54:22.009 --> 54:23.594
Lord INPYEONG will be arrested soon.

54:27.139 --> 54:28.140
Did Jeongwoo

54:29.099 --> 54:30.142
agree to it?

54:31.226 --> 54:32.227
No.

54:33.979 --> 54:35.355
But he'll have no other choice.

54:36.356 --> 54:37.566
I told him I knew…

54:39.485 --> 54:41.028
and that I would not forgive him.

54:54.124 --> 54:55.709
And what you wanted to confirm?

54:56.627 --> 54:57.628
Did you?

55:03.967 --> 55:04.968
No.
:cue

55:43.215 --> 55:45.424
The first-ever compulsory investigation

55:45.425 --> 55:47.134
into a royal relative has been conducted.

55:47.135 --> 55:50.388
The Royal Protection Branch and police
announced they have obtained evidence

55:50.389 --> 55:53.849
that proves Lord INPYEONG's involvement
in Grand Princess Seong's poisoning.

55:53.850 --> 55:56.602
Authorities raided his home
and a research facility affiliated

55:56.603 --> 55:58.020
with the Royal Seoul Hospital.

55:58.021 --> 55:59.605
ROYAL PROTECTION BRANCH

55:59.606 --> 56:01.190
- Look!
- There she is!

56:01.191 --> 56:04.151
The joint investigation task
force stated shipment records of a drug

56:04.152 --> 56:06.946
containing the same substance
administered to the Grand Prince,

56:06.947 --> 56:10.700
as well as a testimony from a staff member
at his private residence, proved decisive.

56:10.701 --> 56:14.078
With a royal relative suspected
in an attempted murder of a royal,

56:14.079 --> 56:16.164
the fallout is expected to be significant.

56:25.340 --> 56:26.466
Your Majesty.

56:27.342 --> 56:29.011
His Majesty has arrived.

56:35.517 --> 56:36.685
Mother.

56:45.277 --> 56:46.278
Your Majesty.

56:47.362 --> 56:48.363
Yes?

56:53.744 --> 56:55.536
You must remain strong.

56:58.415 --> 56:59.583
If you ever feel scared,

57:00.751 --> 57:02.711
you should go to your uncle.

57:04.379 --> 57:05.756
Do you understand?

57:07.215 --> 57:09.468
Yes, Mother.

57:33.617 --> 57:34.910
Your Royal Highness.

57:35.577 --> 57:37.411
This is a misunderstanding.

57:37.412 --> 57:39.288
Why would I ever…

57:39.289 --> 57:40.290
Shut…

57:43.293 --> 57:44.294
that mouth of yours.

57:47.422 --> 57:49.508
History will remember you as a criminal,

57:50.258 --> 57:51.259
and the Crown

57:52.761 --> 57:54.054
will forget you ever existed.

57:56.056 --> 57:59.267
I am His Majesty's grandfather
and the Queen Mother's father.

57:59.935 --> 58:01.227
You cannot treat me like--

58:01.228 --> 58:02.270
Did I not ask you…

58:04.564 --> 58:06.274
to shut that mouth of yours?

58:11.947 --> 58:13.699
The Queen Mother was the one

58:14.991 --> 58:16.326
who told me about your crimes.

58:19.955 --> 58:20.956
Thus…

58:23.083 --> 58:24.543
you should mind your conduct.

58:28.755 --> 58:30.340
The Queen Mother's welfare…

58:32.884 --> 58:34.803
will depend on how deeply…

58:38.181 --> 58:39.349
you repent.
:cue

59:00.579 --> 59:02.080
You did well, Your Royal Highness.

59:06.918 --> 59:08.670
The abdication has been announced.

59:09.546 --> 59:12.131
Public sentiment is strong,
and the foreign media is all over it,

59:12.132 --> 59:13.258
calling it long overdue.

59:13.842 --> 59:16.469
- Let's go to the palace.
- Yes, Your Royal Highness.

59:16.470 --> 59:18.053
Abolition?

59:18.054 --> 59:21.265
How dare anyone suggest
to abolish the monarchy?

59:21.266 --> 59:25.728
Why do we spend all that tax money
preserving the Crown?

59:25.729 --> 59:28.898
Because the investment generates
enough added value to justify the cost.

59:28.899 --> 59:32.234
If the economic and diplomatic benefits
of the Crown vanish,

59:32.235 --> 59:35.321
who exactly will be held accountable?

59:35.322 --> 59:37.990
The people will be up in arms about it.

59:37.991 --> 59:39.909
I'm sure such news will have them

59:39.910 --> 59:41.535
demanding a new king immediately.

59:45.791 --> 59:47.626
That is exactly why…

59:51.671 --> 59:53.340
…we must make him listen.

01:00:26.164 --> 01:00:27.874
You must be busy with the coronation.

01:00:28.959 --> 01:00:30.293
The Grand Prince told me.

01:00:38.468 --> 01:00:39.970
That you had been aware

01:00:42.013 --> 01:00:43.306
of what Lord INPYEONG did.

01:00:50.021 --> 01:00:51.106
Then what about you?

01:00:52.148 --> 01:00:53.649
Did you know?

01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:55.777
That he's looking to abolish the monarchy.

01:01:00.031 --> 01:01:01.032
A king

01:01:02.117 --> 01:01:04.327
doesn't get to do whatever he wants.

01:01:05.036 --> 01:01:06.912
My job is to make sure he doesn't.

01:01:06.913 --> 01:01:08.414
What if it is a necessary evil?

01:01:08.415 --> 01:01:09.707
What?

01:01:09.708 --> 01:01:12.794
What if, in the 21st century,
our Crown itself turns out to be

01:01:14.045 --> 01:01:15.171
the harmful entity?

01:01:17.424 --> 01:01:18.550
What then?

01:01:25.849 --> 01:01:26.933
I already told you.

01:01:28.059 --> 01:01:30.228
That is for the nation to decide.

01:01:39.237 --> 01:01:40.238
It appears…

01:01:46.620 --> 01:01:48.121
we may end up as enemies.

01:02:07.140 --> 01:02:10.727
Announcing His Majesty!

01:02:16.983 --> 01:02:19.527
:cue

01:03:17.919 --> 01:03:20.546
We declare!

01:03:20.547 --> 01:03:22.340
- Long live the King!
- Long live the King!

01:03:25.176 --> 01:03:27.721
- Long live the King!
- Long live the King!

01:03:29.848 --> 01:03:32.434
- Long live the King!
- Long live the King!

01:03:48.533 --> 01:03:51.453
PERFECT CROWN

01:04:28.615 --> 01:04:30.949
All rise
for His Majesty the King!

01:04:30.950 --> 01:04:33.118
Your Majesty.
Abolition of the monarchy?

01:04:33.119 --> 01:04:35.329
Is it true there are talks
of abolishing the monarchy?

01:04:35.330 --> 01:04:37.164
You're saying the Cabinet
and Royal Relatives

01:04:37.165 --> 01:04:38.707
will oppose it, no question?

01:04:38.708 --> 01:04:42.211
Most of the establishment
is connected to the Crown.

01:04:42.212 --> 01:04:43.797
Voice your objection there.

01:04:45.256 --> 01:04:46.632
Simply hint that…

01:04:46.633 --> 01:04:48.634
…is His Majesty's own pursuit.

01:04:48.635 --> 01:04:49.802
What summons?

01:04:49.803 --> 01:04:51.637
It's a slush fund probe.

01:04:51.638 --> 01:04:55.265
And the Cabinet implored me
to fulfill my duties as the King.

01:04:55.266 --> 01:04:57.309
We were simply speaking
on behalf of the public.

01:04:57.310 --> 01:04:59.561
Go and protect His Majesty.

01:04:59.562 --> 01:05:00.730
It's your fault.

01:05:03.066 --> 01:05:05.068
Translated by Justin S. Kim.

01:05:16.371 --> 01:05:20.083
PERFECT CROWN
